    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fantastic 2 bedroom mid-floor apartment located in the heart of Drogheda, Co. Louth. This spacious property is located in Plunket Court, a small residential development on Windmill Road boasting bright living spaces and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Extending to c. 68 sq.m. (732 sq.ft.), the property has excellent access to the M1 Motorway (10 minutes drive), Drogheda Bus station (10 minutes walk) and Drogheda Train Station (15 minutes walk).\nViewing is a must.\n\nAMV 165,000 - For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures \n2 Bedroom Mid-Floor Apartment\nExtends To c. 68 sq.m. (c. 732 sq.ft.)\nReady For Immediate Occupation\nBuilt C. 1997\nCentral Location \nElectric Heating\nPrivate Off Street Parking\nSecure Gated Development\nAnnual Management fee - 1800 \n\n\nAccommodation Includes \nEntrance Hallway\nKitchen(3.02m x 2.10m)\nLounge / Dining (6.90m x 3.40m) \nBedroom 1 (3.28m x 3.62m) \nBedroom 2 (2.35m x 3.62m) \nMain Bathroom (2.28m x 2.10m) \n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: C\n\nViewing Details \nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\n\n"
